# Agent Behavior

- Verify modern API usage, best practices, and current paradigms via context7 MCP (library docs), firecrawl MCP (web research), and `gh` CLI (GitHub repo/code/issue/PR search and viewing) instead of relying on training data or assumptions
- 10+ concurrent subagents is fine — do not self-impose low limits
- Subagent model: inherit from parent by default
